{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12434","headline":"寄永嘉王十二 · 钱起","name":"寄永嘉王十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"永嘉风景入新年，才子诗成定可怜。\n梦里还乡不相见，天涯忆戴复谁传。\n花倾晓露垂如泪，莺拂游丝断若弦。\n愿得回风吹海雁，飞书一宿到君边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}